    "description": "Address space registered to Anthropic, PBC (ARIN organization AP-2440) that was routed on the review date, plus the published outbound allocation that contains the routed API prefix. This is separate from the crawler feed at https://claude.com/crawling/bots.json. Allocations are not emitted whole when only part of them is routed, and a prefix is not emitted when ARIN assigns it to a different organization.",
    "org_handle": "AP-2440",
    "org_name": "Anthropic, PBC",
    "do_not_emit": ["153.61.0.0/16", "2607:6bc0::/32", "209.249.57.0/24"],
    "notes": [
      "Organization: Anthropic, PBC, ARIN handle AP-2440 (https://whois.arin.net/rest/org/AP-2440). AS Rank lists the same organization (https://asrank.caida.org/orgs/b7403dc2df).",
      "AS399358 (ANTHROPIC) originates 160.79.104.0/23, 2607:6bc0::/48, and 2607:6bc0:11::/48. AS400243, AS401551, and AS4167 are registered to the organization and originated nothing on the review date.",
      "160.79.104.0/21 is both the ARIN allocation NET-160-79-104-0-1 and the outbound range Anthropic publishes. The API documentation names 160.79.104.0/23 inside it as the inbound range (https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/ip-addresses). Routing visibility on the review date was the /23.",
      "2607:6bc0::/32 is the ARIN allocation ANTHROPIC-V6. Only 2607:6bc0::/48 (published as the API range) and 2607:6bc0:11::/48 (originated by AS399358, not named on the API page) were routed. The /32 is not emitted.",
      "216.73.216.0/22 is ARIN net AWS-ANTHROPIC, registered to AP-2440 and announced by AS16509 (Amazon). It is already in the crawler feed. https://ipinfo.io/AS16509/216.73.216.0/22",
      "153.61.0.0/16 is an ARIN direct allocation to AP-2440, registered 2026-06-17. The /16 itself was not announced. The routed portions were 153.61.192.0/23 (AS396982, Google Cloud), 153.61.196.0/24 (AS14618, Amazon), 153.61.197.0/24 (AS16509), and 153.61.198.0/24 (AS16509). Adjacent prefixes are collapsed in this file.",
      "Excluded: AS60808 is registered to AP-2440 and originates 209.249.57.0/24 with a valid ROA, but ARIN assigns that net (NET-209-249-57-0-1, ZAYO-IPYX) to Mitel Networks, Inc. It is not treated as Anthropic address space.",
      "POC ANTHR5-ARIN (arin@anthropic.com) is the admin, tech, routing, NOC, abuse, and DNS contact for AP-2440 (https://whois.arin.net/rest/poc/ANTHR5-ARIN). The contact record has no networks of its own. The nets query for AP-2440 returns only the four allocations described above."
